                    Ubuntu
                      |
                  SSH Connection
                      |
          +-----------+-----------+
          |           |           |
          v           v           v
       DEV EC2    STAGING EC2   PROD EC2
          |           |           |
          +-----------+-----------+
                      |
                   site.yml
                      |
             Ansible Automation
                      |
          +-----------+-----------+
          |           |           |
       Packages    Users       Directories
          |           |           |
        Nginx     Templates    Firewall
```

