## 11. Idempotency Testing

Idempotency means repeatedly running the same playbook should not create unnecessary changes when the desired server configuration already exists.

The project was tested across all three environments.

| Environment | Tasks | Changed | Failed |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Development | 18 | 0 | 0 |
| Staging | 18 | 0 | 0 |
| Production | 18 | 0 | 0 |

All three environments passed the final idempotency test.

